DESCRIPTION:Feeling inquisitive? Looking for good conversation? Love scien
 ce and books? The Book Club for the Curious is just the thing for you. Cre
 ated at the Museum of Science\, Boston and presented in partnership with t
 he CIC\, this reading group is designed especially for those who are inter
 ested in science and technology and how it impacts our society. Location: 
 CIC\, Charles Conference Room\, 14th Floor\, One Broadway\, Cambridge\, Ma
 ssachusetts Guests who arrive after 5:30 p.m. must call the conference roo
 m from the 14th Floor lobby to be let in. Time and location is subject to 
 change. Parking at One Broadway is a flat rate of $10 for those who enter 
 after 5:00 p.m. The Kendall Square T-stop is a short walk away on Main Str
 eet.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event
 /book-club-for-the-curious/40131/
