  has gone wrong in a way that results in a compelling\, interesting image.
  Hours: Sunday / Monday 11:30am - 9pm Tuesday through Thursday 11:30am -10
 pm Friday / Saturday 11:30am - 11pm Admission: free\n\nSources: Meet Bosto
 n\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/museum-of-bad-art/79503/
