UID:c0dbe6e56b4fb533213fece8a2ec12@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Our seasonal high speed passenger ferry service to Martha’s 
 Vineyard gets you to Oak Bluffs quickly in just 1 hour. Whether you are he
 aded out for the day\, or looking to stay for a longer visit\, our frequen
 t daily departures are sure to fit into your schedule. Speed\, comfort\, a
 nd convenience… what more could you ask for? Reservations are the only w
 ay to guarantee available space. Please arrive at least 45 minutes prior t
 o departure to allow for drop-off\, parking\, and ticketing. LEARN MORE\n
 \nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/marth
 as-vineyard-ferry/91238/
