UID:e0ae51693e47ed4a7e3bfbccf78343@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A Taste of the Freedom Trail combines Boston's most iconic lan
 dmarks with the city's legendary local foods. Walk the historic Freedom Tr
 ail while enjoying generous tastings of New England favorites like creamy 
 clam chowder\, buttery lobster rolls\, and other local specialties at belo
 ved restaurants along the way. More than a history tour or a food tour\, t
 his is Boston's story told through its flavors. Along the route\, your loc
 al guide shares fascinating stories of Indigenous foodways\, colonial trad
 itions\, immigration\, and the people who shaped the city's culinary ident
 ity. Enjoy seated tastings at several restaurants\, small groups (maximum 
 12 guests)\, water provided throughout the tour\, and plenty of insider re
 commendations to help you make the most of your time in Boston. Come hungr
 y—you'll leave full of great food\, local history\, and hidden gems! MOR
 E INFO/ BUY TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetb
 oston.com/event/taste-of-the-freedom-trail-downtown-boston-food-tour/91656
 /
