 our\, this experience introduces you to the chefs\, makers\, and entrepren
 eurs who have helped shape the South End into one of Boston's most excitin
 g culinary destinations. Along the way\, your local guide shares stories o
 f the neighborhood's rich history\, diverse community\, and thriving food 
 scene. Enjoy primarily seated tastings with individual portions\, small gr
