DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:c314120ac4243dbb7ff4e5972c8027@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Pizza\, Pasta & Pastry is the ultimate way to experience Bosto
 n's iconic North End. Stroll the charming cobblestone streets of Little It
 aly while indulging in generous tastings of award-winning Neapolitan pizza
 \, handmade pasta paired with Italian wine\, the neighborhood's famous squ
 id ink pasta\, and a classic cannoli with cappuccino. Along the way\, your
  local guide shares the fascinating stories behind the families\, traditio
 ns\, and generations of Italian immigrants who transformed this tiny neigh
 borhood into one of America's most celebrated food destinations. Discover 
 the history behind beloved bakeries\, cafés\, and restaurants that contin
 ue to define the North End today. Enjoy seated tastings at family-owned es
 tablishments\, small groups (maximum 12 guests)\, a relaxed walking pace\,
  and plenty of insider recommendations to help you explore the neighborhoo
 d like a local. Come hungry—you'll leave with a full stomach\, unforgett
 able stories\, and a newfound appreciation for Boston's Little Italy! MORE
  INFO/ BUY TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetbo
 ston.com/event/north-end-pizza-pasta-%26-pastry-food-tour/91657/
LOCATION:Rose Kennedy Greenway\, Rose Kennedy Greenway\, Boston\, MA\, 021
 16
