DTEND:20260902T020000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:6685a505e7978c5c0ad86e934499b9@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Get a first hand view into the world of Boston's underground. 
 The Boston Crime Tour was meticulously researched and created by Boston na
 tives who grew up in the very neighborhoods where James "Whitey" Bulger an
 d his Winter Hill Gang operated. Learn the true story of how Boston's Iris
 h mobsters\, lead by Bulger\, ran amuck in the city of Boston by keeping t
 he Boston Police\, State Police\, and FBI on their payroll. While the tour
  does cover dark material\, our guides make it fun and do add moments of h
 umor. Due to the language we recommend the tour for ages 12+\n\nSources: M
