DTEND:20261112T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:8c6c57821f0cd7207425104e8277b6@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:This six-week dance workshop is designed around discovering pe
 rsonal movement motifs\, connecting and interacting with others and explor
 ing the possibilities of shared movement. Through guided exercises\, creat
 ive play and collaborative practice\, participants will develop meaningful
  dance duos rooted in curiosity\, trust and authentic expression. This is 
 an all-ages\, all-ability opportunity to find in oneself and others the co
 mmon & diverse threads that connect body\, experience and potential in art
  and life. Leda Muhana and Dave Iannitelli have directed the Movimento Pro
 ject since moving to Brewster in 2015. Their background and goals include 
 exploring contemporary dance-making as art\, education and community build
 ing.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.
 org/event/unscripted-encounters%3a-contemporary-dance-making-and-the-poetr
 y-of-motion/52664/
