DESCRIPTION:Annie is a heartwarming\, family-friendly musical about an opt
 imistic young orphan who believes that better days are always ahead. Fille
 d with memorable songs\, lively dance numbers\, and plenty of humor\, the 
 musical celebrates hope\, resilience\, friendship\, and the power of looki
 ng on the bright side. Featuring beloved classics such as Tomorrow and It
 ’s the Hard-Knock Life\, Annie remains one of the most popular and endur
 ing musicals for audiences of all ages.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent pag
