BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Love/Sick
DTSTART:20261105T000000
DTEND:20261121T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:66688c35a356e206c4d8933a5a8b52@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:“Entertaining and fun. A satisfyingly dark look at this thin
 g we call love.” -Broadway World. Let’s be honest: sometimes love is a
 n absolute\, beautiful mess. From the creator of Almost\, Maine comes Love
 /Sick by John Cariani\, an absurdly funny\, and deeply human look at the u
 ps and downs of the heart. Through a series of fast-paced\, witty vignette
 s\, we see couples navigating the vulnerable\, awkward\, and profoundly ho
 nest moments of being together. There are no fairy tales\; this play holds
  up a mirror to the realities of love in all its glorious imperfection as 
 we laugh at ourselves and the clumsy\, hopeful ways we try to connect. Com
 e for the laughs\, stay for the moments that make you go\, "Yeah\, I’ve 
 been there." Whether you’re single\, coupled\, or somewhere in the messy
  middle\, you just might find a piece of your own love story on stage. Dir
 ected by Jay Are Adams. Please note: tildenartscenter.ludus.com is the onl
 y place to purchase tickets to Cape Cod Community College productions. Tic
 kets may not be resold and are non-transferable. We are a will call venue.
  When you arrive please give the ushers your name and they will check you 
 in. If you need to exchange your tickets for a different date\, please con
 tact the box office at least 24 hours in advance at 774-330-4044.\n\nSourc
 es: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/lov
 e-sick/52712/
LOCATION:Cape Cod Community College\, 2240 Iyannough Road Building #1\, We
 st Barnstable\, MA\, 02668
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/love-sick/52712/
END:VEVENT
