UID:5fae9756ab4260f6f70b7aa5d5ef7b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Ripping up the expected blueprint Geese set with their 2021 de
 but Projector and the cowboy rock follow-up of 2023’s 3D Country\, Getti
 ng Killed puts the very idea of conventional rock structures in the band
 ’s crosshairs. Working at a feverish clip with renowned producer Kenneth
  Blume over a month-long stretch\, Geese emerged wielding a sharp\, novel 
 new vision for the genre\, sporting wry smiles and a resolute confidence. 
 The album was crowned the number one album of the year on numerous Best of
  2025 lists including TIME\, The New Yorker\, The New York Times and more.
  The band began 2026 right where they left off\, with an unwieldy\, vexing
  SNL debut\, a surprisingly intimate Tiny Desk concert and winning a BRIT 
 Award for International Group of the Year.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent 
 page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/geese/93202/
