SUMMARY:Wood You Be Mine Release Day
DTSTART:20261110T000000
DTEND:20261110T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:d1b1523f77c38d15801059efc89b70@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A grumpy small-town lumberjack and his sunny new-in-town neigh
 bor cross axes and risk their hearts. Celebrate Wood You Be Mine release d
 ay with romance author Daphne Elliot! In conversation with fellow romance 
 author Brittanée Nicole\, Daphne will unpack the steamy small-town romanc
 e filled with flirty banter\, sexy flannel\, and plenty of heart. When a d
 etermined elementary school principal moves in next door to grumpy lumberj
 ack Henri Gagnon\, things get off to a slightly disastrous start\, involvi
 ng a near-burned-down cabin\, an argument with a moose\, and eventually\, 
 one very memorable naked encounter. With one year to prove herself and sav
 e her job\, she definitely does not have time to pine over her flannel-cla
 d landlord\, especially when he looks that good chopping wood. Sit back an
 d enjoy a discussion of all things small-town romance\, found family\, irr
 esistible chemistry\, and the men who fall first! LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS
 \n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/woo
 d-you-be-mine-release-day/94188/
LOCATION:Lovestruck Books\, Lovestruck Books 44 Brattle Street\, Cambridge
 \, MA\, 02138
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/wood-you-be-mine-release-day/94188/
END:VEVENT
