UID:f0a2f32439a49bf2d504410b303e06@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Tides of Light Wellness Retreat at Wequassett w
 ithout an overnight stay. Join us for a restorative experience filled with
  connection\, discovery\, and renewal\, including Friday’s welcome dinne
 r\, a hands-on chocolate-making class\, and all wellness workshops. Friday
 \, November 13 5:30pm | Welcome Reception & Dinner | Private Dining Room |
  Gather for a warm welcome and thoughtfully prepared dinner as you settle 
 in\, connect with fellow guests and begin your weekend of wellness and dis
 covery. 8:30pm | Whispers in the Flame (1hr) | As evening falls\, settle i
 nto a guided reflection and restorative Yoga Nidra experience designed to 
 create space for stillness\, rest and renewal. Saturday\, November 14 9am 
 | Ebb & Flow Vinyasa yoga (45-60 min) | Sea Glass Cottage | Begin your day
  with practices designed to awaken the body\, quiet the mind\, and bring g
 reater awareness to your breath and presence. 10am | Meditation: Tides of 
 Light (30-45 min) | Sea Glass Cottage | Journey inward to nurture your inn
 er radiance and become a beacon of light\, fan your flame\, and restore ba
 lance to the mind\, body\, and spirit. 11am | Voice & Vessel: Breathwork &
  Somatic Expression (45-60 min) | Sea Glass Cottage | Explore the connecti
 on between breath\, movement\, and sound through vocal resonance\, somatic
  practices\, and a cappella chanting—an uplifting experience that invite
 s you to find and express your authentic voice. noon – 2pm Lunch on own 
 2pm | Chocolate Making (90 min) | Private Dining Room | Indulge your creat
 ive side with a hands-on chocolate-making experience\, offering a playful 
 pause to savor the moment. 4pm | Sunset Sharing Circle & Surrender to the 
 Sea Release Ceremony (1hr+) | Gather as the day winds down for a reflectiv
 e walk and sharing circle inspired by the rhythm of the tide\, the changin
 g light and the beauty of letting go. 5:30pm Dinner on own 8:30pm | Sound 
 Bath (1hr+) | Sea Glass Cottage | Close the day immersed in soothing sound
 s and vibrations\, allowing the body and mind to settle into deep relaxati
 on and restorative rest. Sunday\, November 15 9am | Morning Yoga | Sea Gla
 ss Cottage 10am | Closing Ceremony | Sea Glass Cottage | Gather one final 
 time to reflect\, reconnect and celebrate the insights\, energy and connec
 tions cultivated throughout the weekend. Leave with intention\, gratitude 
 and your inner light shining a little brighter.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamb
 er\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/lake-austin-weekend-w
 ellness-retreat-without-the-overnight/52501/
LOCATION:Wequassett Resort & Golf Club\, 2173 Route 28\, Harwich\, MA\, 02
 645
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/lake-austin-weekend-wellness-retr
 eat-without-the-overnight/52501/
