DESCRIPTION:The Vinyl Listening Lounge is back! Join Cape Symphony Present
 s at The Old Village Store for an evening inspired by Tokyo’s jazz café
 s. Rooted in Japan’s jazz kissa tradition\, listening lounges bring peop
 le together to slow down and appreciate carefully selected records on exce
 ptional sound systems. Settle into a seat\, enjoy something delicious\, an
 d let the music take center stage. Rooted in Japan’s jazz kissa traditio
 n\, listening lounges bring people together to slow down and appreciate ca
 refully selected records on exceptional sound systems. Settle into a seat
 \, enjoy something delicious\, and let the music take center stage. DJ Rhy
 thmryder brings more than 30 years of selecting records\, curating music\,
  and shaping audio experiences to this Tokyo jazz session. A high-fidelity
  sound system paired with the room’s excellent acoustics will bring out 
 the warmth\, texture\, and detail of every record. With delicious food\, g
 reat wine and beer selections\, and shelves filled with books and local fi
 nds\, The Old Village Store offers something for everyone in a welcoming n
 eighborhood setting. Friday\, November 13\, 2026 | 5–8 PM The Old Villag
 e Store\, West Barnstable Bring a friend and discover your next favorite r
 ecord. This is a free event. Seating is first come\, first served. Arrive 
 early to grab a seat!\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://ww
 w.capecodchamber.org/event/listening-lounge%3a-jazz-kissa/52718/
