DESCRIPTION:Wildwood Acres Farm & Forest School invites families to the En
 chanted Forest Winter Faire\, a wintery Renaissance faire where kids take 
 center stage. Wander a forest village filled with skilled artisans and tra
 ditional vendors\, plus the Kids Medieval Makers Market\, where young merc
 hants sell goods they made themselves. Wandering characters\, storytellers
  and performers bring the woods to life throughout the day\, and King Wint
 er will be holding court. Children can try hands-on crafts and make their 
 own magical and medieval treasures\, visit the Winter Wish House and toast
  s'mores by the fire. Food and drink will be available. Costumes HIGHLY en
 couraged! Kings\, queens\, fairies\, jesters and every kind of magical cre
 ature are welcome. Admission is free. The faire runs 11 AM to 4 PM on Satu
 rday\, November 14\, 2026\, with a rain date of Sunday\, November 15. Wild
 wood Acres is a nonprofit farm and forest school at 147 Wigwam Rd\, West B
 rookfield. Event page: https://wwoodacres.com/events Facebook event: https
 ://www.facebook.com/events/920945574118394\n\nSources: Discover Central Ma
 ssachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/enchanted
 -forest-winter-faire/31055/
LOCATION:Wildwood Acres Farm & Forest School\, 147 Wigwam Rd\, West Brookf
 ield\, MA\, 01585
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/enchanted-forest-winter-faire/
 31055/
