 own real-fruit ice cream\, and decorate a delicious waffle-bowl masterpiec
 e. Here’s what’s in store: 🎨 Dream up your swirl: Start with a flav
 or-design activity card and choose your ice cream and fruit combination. 
 🔎 Become a taste detective: Explore a mini ice cream tasting flight\, u
 se color and taste as clues\, and guess the mystery fruits. Which taste ge
 ts your vote? 🍦 Make some swirl magic: Take a turn at our ice cream mac
 hine with help from the Far Out team and your supervising adult. Watch rea
 l fruit blend into your very own New Zealand–style ice cream! ✨ Top it
  off: Head to the topping station to decorate your waffle bowl\, then enjo
 y your one-of-a-kind creation. The sweet details 📅 Sunday\, November 15
 \, 2026 🕙 10:00–11:30 AM 📍 Far Out Ice Cream — Cleveland Circle 
 🎟️ $35 per child\, including one supervising adult\, the activities\,
  a mini tasting flight\, and one finished ice cream creation. Children par
 ticipate alongside their supervising adult\, who must stay for the full ev
 ent. Activities run in small groups\, with flavor designing and tasting be
 tween machine turns. Bring your curiosity\, your creativity\, and your fav
 orite grown-up—we’ll bring the swirl! LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n\nSour
