SUMMARY:Winemaker Supper Club No.1
DTSTART:20261115T000000
DTEND:20261115T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:7810391457667bbff2a293c559726c@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Winemaker Supper Club @ Marzae where we partner wit
 h local chefs to pair our natural wines with terroir-driven tasting menus 
 Marzae Cellar + Provisions is thrilled to feature Chef Mark Lawless for ou
 r first Winemaker Supper Club! Mark will be stepping in as our full-time e
 xecutive chef beginning this February. He's been cooking professionally fo
 r almost 18 years. Most recently\, Mark has been at Bar Mezzana while harn
 essing global flavors from local purveyors through pop-ups and private din
 ners from the No Rules No Worries Experience. Terroir-driven food + wine f
 rom Massachusetts' first natural winery? This is a dining experience you d
 o not want to miss! Marzae's thoughts on wine and community: We believe wi
 ne is only as good as it is for the land from which it comes\, those that 
 tend the land\, and how our neighbors are treated. All too often\, labor a
 nd other business practices go overlooked in discussions around sustainabi
 lity and natural wine—Simply put\, we don’t think we should exist if w
 e’re not treating people and the planet right. PLEASE NOTE: The market w
 ill be closed at 6pm so you will have to enter from the corner of Congress
  and Sudbury as all other doors will be locked. LEARN MORE / RESERVE\n\nSo
 urces: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/winemaker
 -supper-club-no-1/93872/
LOCATION:Marzae Cellar + Provisions\, Marzae Cellar + Provisions 100 Hanov
 er Street\, Boston\, MA\, 02108
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/winemaker-supper-club-no-1/93872/
END:VEVENT
