DTEND:20261220T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:ba42d2cf6cc580b31eedc766645f5f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Celebrating 20 years of holiday magic at Highfield Hall & Gard
 ens. This year’s Holidays at Highfield exhibition\, ’Twas the Night Be
 fore Christmas: Life Above & Below Stairs \, invites visitors to experienc
 e the final hours before Christmas morning in a grand Gilded Age mansion. 
 As the Beebe family eagerly awaits the holiday ‘above stairs’\, the se
 rvants ‘below stairs’ work tirelessly behind the scenes to prepare for
  the festivities ahead. Filled with festive beauty\, historic charm\, and 
 delightful discoveries\, the exhibition offers an immersive holiday experi
 ence for visitors of all ages. The beloved Gift Gallery returns with handc
 rafted artisan gifts\, while the holiday craft room provides hands-on fun 
 for children and families. Gather family and friends and celebrate the sea
 son with one of Cape Cod’s most beloved holiday traditions. Register onl
 ine today or call 508-495-1878 ext. 2.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent
  page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/holidays-at-highfield-%26%2382
 11%3b-%e2%80%99twas-the-night-before-christmas%3a-life-above-%26-below-sta
 irs/50404/
