SUMMARY:Twilight Hours: Holidays at Highfield After Dark
DTSTART:20261120T000000
DTEND:20261218T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:dd48add69e90a3e1bc5b143c417c78@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Celebrating 20 years of holiday magic at Highfield Hall & Gard
 ens. As dusk settles and the mansion begins to glow\, experience ’Twas t
 he Night Before Christmas: Life Above & Below Stairs after hours at Highfi
 eld Hall. Enjoy libations and light snacks and as you stroll through beaut
 ifully decorated rooms and immerse yourself in the charm of a Gilded Age C
 hristmas. Designed for a relaxed and atmospheric visit\, Friday Twilight H
 ours invites you to explore the exhibition at your own pace while enjoying
  the magic of the mansion after dark including browsing the beloved Gift G
 allery featuring handcrafted artisan gifts. With spectacular decorations\,
  seasonal music\, and whimsical displays\, Friday Twilight Hours offers a 
 memorable holiday evening. ADMISSION: $35 per Adult for Friday Twilight Ho
 urs (libations & light snacks provided) Advanced registration is recommend
 ed as attendance is limited. Please note: Twilight Hours is intended as an
  evening experience for adults and older teens (accompanied by an adult). 
 Families with young children may prefer to visit during our regular daytim
 e exhibition hours. Register online today or call 508-495-1878 ext. 2.\n\n
 Sources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/even
 t/twilight-hours%3a-holidays-at-highfield-after-dark/52500/
