DTEND:20261121T134000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:44bfc571558434d5e952fdf58f9c1b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Bring the whole family for a magical afternoon of music\, laug
 hter\, and happily ever after! Bullied by her two mean stepsisters\, Cinde
 rella’s future looks bleak—until her Fairy Godmother casts a spell and
  sends her to the ball! But when she flees at midnight\, leaving behind a 
 single glass slipper\, how will the Prince ever find her? The Panto Compan
 y USA brings this beloved fairy tale to life in a true-to-story musical fi
 lled with original songs and more hilarity than you can imagine. And\, of 
 course\, there’s the perfect happy ending! Join us for a fairy-tale adve
 nture the whole family can enjoy. Reserve your seats today! Pumpkin parkin
 g encouraged! Run Time: Approx. 1 hour and 10 minutes\, includes intermiss
 ion Ages: 3 to 93 – a true family event! [Thelarcom.org/cinderella](http
 s://www.thelarcom.org/cinderella)\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page:
  https://northofboston.org/event/cinderella/
