 oper Bostonian\, Will has appeared on FOX\, Hulu\, Gotham Comedy Live\, NP
 R’s This American Life\, and in the Netflix film The Sleepover. He is al
 so familiar to audiences across New England as “The Honda Guy” from hi
 s popular television and radio commercials. Joining him is feature comedia
 n Will Smalley\, a standout voice in the Boston comedy scene known for his
  clever\, personal\, and refreshingly original comedy. Boston comedian Rya
 n Ellington will host the evening and keep the laughs and energy flowing f
 rom start to finish. Grab your tickets early for a night packed with some 
