DTSTART:20261123T000000
DTEND:20261123T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:1b958041ecd84cf2734ee09120244d@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Blind tasting is how wine professionals understand a wine with
 out any preconceived biases\, and it's also a lot of fun. We'll pour six w
 ines without telling you what they are\, and through an interactive matchi
 ng game you'll come to your own conclusions about each one. Come taste som
 e wine\, have some laughs\, and maybe even surprise yourself.\n\nSources: 
 Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/wine-cl
 ass%3a-guess-that-wine!-learn-to-blind-taste/52715/
