BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Love In Lights at Love Farms: A Cape Cod Christmas Light Experienc
 e
DTSTART:20261127T000000
DTEND:20261220T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:1f2ea665643d3de4441591835f2fe7@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A Cape Cod holiday tradition! Explore Love Farms’ winter won
 derland\, visit Santa\, and cozy up by the fire. Timed entry\, Nov 27–Ja
 n 2. Santa Is Coming to Love Farms! Make this the year your family’s hol
 iday tradition starts at Love in Lights.This holiday season\, Love Farms i
 n West Dennis transforms into a glowing winter wonderland. Follow twinklin
 g lights across the lawn and through the farm\, discover whimsical holiday
  displays\, and soak up the magic of the season on Cape Cod—including a 
 special photo opportunity with Santa on the Farm Tour! A Little Wonder Aro
 und Every Corner Explore at your own pace and make memories along the way:
  Santa’s Sleigh: Stop for a festive photo full of Christmas magic. Giant
  Ornament Lawn Installation: Discover a larger-than-life backdrop for your
  holiday pictures. Candy Cane Lane: Wander through the bamboo forest\, tra
 nsformed into a whimsical holiday pathway. Letters to Santa Station: Share
  your Christmas wishes with the North Pole. Tour the Farm & Santa Visit: F
 ollow the sparkling lights\, say hello to our pigs and chickens\, and visi
 t Santa along the way for a special holiday photo opportunity! Cozy Up & E
 njoy the Season Gather around the firepits on the patio\, enjoy festive mu
 sic\, and warm up with a cup from our outdoor cocoa station. Food from our
  holiday menu will be available for purchase outdoors to enjoy on the pati
 o\, so come hungry and stay awhile! Be sure to visit Mrs. Claus’ Sweet S
 hop\, too\, for house-made treats available for purchase. Food and beverag
 es are not included with admission. General admission: $35 per person for 
 adults and children ages 3 and older. Children under 3 are free. Dates & T
 ickets: November 27\, 2026–January 2\, 2027 Open Thursday through Sunday
 \, plus these additional holiday dates: December 21–23 December 28–30 
 Closed December 24 and 25.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https
 ://www.capecodchamber.org/event/love-in-lights-at-love-farms%3a-a-cape-cod
 -christmas-light-experience/52729/
LOCATION:Love Farms\, 607 Main St\, West Dennis\, MA\, 02670
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/love-in-lights-at-love-farms%3a-a
 -cape-cod-christmas-light-experience/52729/
END:VEVENT
