BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Canteen Holiday Market
DTSTART:20261127T000000
DTEND:20270102T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:436099a67f40499f232e1e16f1781c@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The 12th Annual Holiday Market returns to The Canteen! It's th
 e most wonderful time of the year in Provincetown! Join us every weekend f
 rom Thanksgiving through New Year's as we transform The Canteen into a fes
 tive holiday marketplace filled with local makers\, artists\, and small bu
 sinesses! With 26 vendors daily\, there's always something new to discover
 . Shop local\, find one-of-a-kind gifts\, enjoy specialty holiday food and
  drinks\, and soak up a little holiday magic with us. And the festivities 
 don't stop at shopping! We'll be celebrating the season with live music\, 
 tea dances\, festive food and drink specials\, and plenty of holiday cheer
  throughout the market. 12 years of celebrating community\, creativity\, a
 nd the holiday season right here in Provincetown.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Cha
 mber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/the-canteen-holiday
 -market/52733/
