DESCRIPTION:Gather the family for an afternoon of frosting\, sprinkles\, a
 nd holiday imagination at Wequassett. Inside the festive Waterfront Pavili
 on\, gingerbread houses become snowy cottages\, candy-covered hideaways\, 
 and whatever else your imagination dreams up. Build\, decorate\, and make 
