 complimentary buffet created just for little ones. Festive cocktails will 
 be available for adults to purchase\, making this a holiday tradition ever
 yone can enjoy. Whether your gingerbread house is perfectly polished or wo
 nderfully whimsical\, the best part is making it together. Open to the pub
 lic\, members\, and resort guests! More Details here: Gingerbread House Pa
