DTSTART:20261128T000000
DTEND:20261128T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:2d7749c635dab800a163e1dd137603@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Lighting of the Lobster Pot Tree is a Provincetown traditi
 on that rings in the holiday season. Started in 2004 by artist Julian Popk
 o who wanted to design a holiday celebration that recognized the hard-work
 ing local lobstermen\, the “tree” is made of real lobster traps\, and 
 has become a beloved tradition. Held at 5:30 pm at Lopes Square (Commercia
 l and Standish Street) in Provincetown.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEven
 t page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/lighting-of-the-lobster-pot-t
 ree/45363/
