BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Holiday Tabletop Boxwood Tree Workshop with Anna Holmes
DTSTART:20261201T000000
DTEND:20261201T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:367a24d7e2d7293a553b9fbe58ba0b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:An annual favorite\, this workshop is a great way to celebrate
  and decorate for the holidays! Join Anna Holmes to create your own tablet
 op tree with fresh boxwood branches\, lights\, ornaments\, and ribbons. Yo
 ur finished tree will be about 18-20” high and about 15” at the base. 
 Please bring small hand clippers\, scissors\, and a box that is about 18
 ” square to transport your tree. Anna will provide everything else neede
 d to create your tree! Please register by November 23rd. Register online t
 oday or call 508-495-1878 ext. 2.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page
