DTEND:20261204T000000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:dfb97939f4a41a0e1237961aaf7782@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:This December\, Cape Cod Music Society is thrilled to present 
 the 6th Annual "Christmas Around the World - Holiday Hits"\, returning big
 ger than ever with an expanded five-concert series across Cape Cod. Follow
 ing last year’s successful three-concert series\, including sold-out per
 formances\, this year’s events will bring even more opportunities to exp
 erience this extraordinary holiday tradition. Join us for an unforgettable
  evening of holiday music featuring the Cape Cod String Quartet - Dan Flon
 ta\, Jeff Pearson\, Sofia Nikas\, Nancy Torrente - and friends - Jonathan 
 Weir\, Anna McEntee\, Emma Fahle\, Antonio Abate\, William Pernice\, Bart 
 Weisman\, James Peterson and Catherine Bonnett - performing a mix of moder
 n holiday favorites and timeless classics. The program will take audiences
  on a musical sleigh ride through some of the greatest hits of the season
 \, including All I Want for Christmas\, Baby It’s Cold Outside\, Happy X
 mas (War Is Over)\, Do They Know It’s Christmas?\, Christmas (Baby Pleas
 e Come Home)\, Run Rudolph Run\, White Christmas\, Silver Bells\, The Chri
 stmas Song (Chestnuts Roasting on an Open Fire)\, Sleigh Ride\, and many m
 ore. Performances: Friday December 4\, 2026 - 7:00 PM Chatham Bars Inn - 2
 97 Shore Rd\, Chatham\, MA 02633 Tickets: https://www.capecodmusicsociety.
 org/event-details/christmas-around-the-world-holiday-hits-2026-chatham-bar
 s-inn-sixth-annual-concert-series\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page
 : https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/christmas-around-the-world-%26%2382
 11%3b-holiday-hits-2026/52746/
LOCATION:Chatham Bars Inn - 297 Shore Rd\, Chatham\, Chatham Bars Inn 297 
 Shore Rd\, Chatham\, MA\, 02633
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/christmas-around-the-world-%26%23
 8211%3b-holiday-hits-2026/52746/
END:VEVENT
