UID:6982b66c3f3c7f78983ef6b36b9cf6@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Homeownership Education Program Buying your first home is not 
 easy\, especially with rising housing costs and interest rates. The good n
 ews is that homebuyer education will help you find resources and tools to 
 achieve your housing and financial goals. Purchasing a home is one of the 
 most important financial decisions you will make. CDP’s homebuyer educat
 ion includes FTHB (First Time Home Buyer) workshops and Individual Counsel
 ing. We are here to help you get started and get closer to your goals of f
 inancial freedom and one day owning a home.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\n
 Event page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/virtual-first-time-homebu
 yer-workshop/52728/
LOCATION:Community Development Partnership\, 180 Cranberry Hwy Unit 5\, Or
 leans\, MA\, 02653
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/virtual-first-time-homebuyer-work
 shop/52728/
END:VEVENT
