UID:efc4cea48449e3a7391d7a6aaf4592@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A holiday market for gamers\, inside Everwinter at the DoubleT
 ree in Danvers. Expect friendly local game stores\, used models\, board ga
 me demos\, handmade goods\, custom dice\, art\, and plenty of other gear w
 orth taking home. We have 25+ vendors confirmed this year. If you have bee
 n trying to figure out what to get the gamer in your life for the holidays
 \, this is worth the trip. Bring the family and give yourself an afternoon
  to walk through it all. Free parking. Kids 17 and under are $15 and under
