BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Homeschool Adventures: Session 1
DTSTART:20261215T130000
DTEND:20261215T160000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:47fa7346a3438e7103ba5de5595480@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Young explorers are invited to join us in September & October 
 for a 4-part homeschool series that will get them active & moving with nat
 ure adventures\, exercise\, and outdoor skill building. While exploring Ap
 pleton Farms & the Crane Estate\, participants complete active adventures 
 & design challenges that will exercise both their body & mind. Some potent
 ial activities include kayaking\, tide pooling\, wetland exploration\, ori
 enteering\, gardening\, obstacle course design\, and more! This is a drop-
 off program that is open to ages 5-11 and will include small group activit
 ies based on age and peer mentoring opportunities between age groups. The 
 class takes place rain or shine\, with as much time spent outdoors as poss
 ible. Students should arrive dressed for the weather and bring a lunch and
  water bottle. Homeschool Adventures: Session 1- This 4-class series progr
 am takes place on Tuesday afternoons from 1-4pm on September 15\, 22\, 29 
 & October 6. September 15: Tidepool & Shoreline Exploration at the Crane E
 state September 22: Kayaking Adventure at the Crane Estate September 29: P
 onding & Invasive Species Management at Appleton Farms October 6: Obstacle
  Course Design Challenge at Appleton Farms Tuition for the 4 classes is $2
 75 for Trustees Members and $325 for nonmembers. Registration covers all l
 isted session dates.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://nort
 hofboston.org/event/homeschool-adventures-session-1/2026-12-15/
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/homeschool-adventures-session-1/2026-1
 2-15/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Squirrel Nut Zippers
DTSTART:20261215T193000
DTEND:20261215T213000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:77ad4a489537333b59e93a478244f3@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:From Hot to the holidays: Squirrel Nut Zippers keep the 30th a
 nniversary celebration going with their festive Christmas Caravan tour. Th
 e Squirrel Nut Zippers return with their beloved Christmas Caravan Tour\, 
 bringing a festive blend of vintage jazz\, New Orleans swing\, folk tradit
 ions\, and holiday spirit to audiences nationwide. Following a successful 
 year celebrating the 30th anniversary of their platinum-certified breakthr
 ough album Hot with a special anniversary tour\, the band continues the ce
 lebration by bringing their singular musical magic to the holiday season. 
 Part holiday spectacular\, part musical time machine\, the Christmas Carav
 an combines seasonal classics\, fan-favorite selections from the band’s 
 acclaimed Christmas Caravan album\, and highlights from the Squirrel Nut Z
 ippers’ celebrated catalog. From heartwarming ballads and spirited sing-
 alongs to rollicking dance numbers\, the show creates an atmosphere that f
 eels equally at home beneath twinkling Christmas lights and inside a livel
 y Prohibition-era speakeasy.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: http
 s://northofboston.org/event/squirrel-nut-zippers/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/squirrel-nut-zippers/
END:VEVENT
