 Comedy at The Cut with national headliner\, Janelle Draper\, Boston favori
 te Big D\, Boston Comedy Festival standout Dan Hall\, and the clean and hi
 larious Kathy Gilmour! Show starts at 5pm. You can order food from table a
 nd rail seats and enjoy dinner and a show!\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEv
 ent page: https://northofboston.org/event/nye-comedy-show/
