BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seasonal Saturday Tours!
DTSTART:20270102T110000
DTEND:20270102T160000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:5297dc5f307c1c4e88742ef940727e@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Fall and Winter Guided Tours at the Museum of Old Newbury Begi
 nning in mid-October\, 2026\, the Museum of Old Newbury will open its door
 s for guided tours every Saturday. Tours begin on the hour from 11:00 a.m.
  to 4:00 p.m. (last tour departs at 3:00 p.m.). Please note: certain dates
  are excluded\, and tours are weather permitting. Step back in time as you
 r knowledgeable guide leads you through two floors of our 1808 brick Feder
 al-style home\, where every room is filled with objects\, stories\, and me
 mories of Old Newbury. Along the way\, you’ll hear tales of the families
  who lived here\, discover treasures from our collection\, and gain new in
 sight into the rich history of Newburyport and the surrounding area. Wheth
 er you’re a first-time visitor or a longtime resident\, this is your cha
 nce to experience the museum in a whole new way—through a carefully cura
 ted\, guided experience designed to bring history to life.\n\nSources: Nor
 th of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/seasonal-saturda
 y-tours-2/2027-01-02/
LOCATION:Museum of Old Newbury\, 98 High Street\, Newburyport\, MA\, 01950
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/seasonal-saturday-tours-2/2027-01-02/
END:VEVENT
