BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Musae Vocal
DTSTART:20270120T190000
DTEND:20270120T210000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:ee5255466fbc5a39fd09e51524ebe7@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Musae\, America’s premier female vocal band\, captivates aud
 iences with dazzling harmonies\, dynamic arrangements\, and infectious ene
 rgy. Having performed at leading a cappella festivals around the world and
  appeared on NBC’s The Sing-Off\, the quintet combines exceptional vocal
  artistry with engaging stage presence. From pop favorites to original wor
 ks\, Musae delivers an unforgettable concert that showcases the power\, ve
 rsatility\, and excitement of contemporary vocal music. Introducing Jessie
 \, Angela\, Jo\, Lily\, and Mel\, the extraordinary talent behind Musae\, 
 America’s top Female Vocal Band. With a remarkable journey that began in
  2011\, these dynamic individuals have graced television screens\, captiva
 ting audiences on shows like NBC’s The Sing-Off and Pop Network’s Sing
  It On\, while also achieving recognition at the ICCA Finals. Musae has pr
 oudly headlined illustrious music festivals both domestically and internat
 ionally\, including The Hong Kong A Cappella Festival\, London A Cappella 
 Festival\, Taiwan Spring Vocal Fest\, Boston Sings\, The National A Cappel
 la Convention\, SoJam Festival\, Kettering A Cappella Festival\, Los Angel
 es A Cappella Fest\, and many more! Not limited to their awe-inspiring per
 formances\, Musae members have proven their prowess in songwriting\, audio
  engineering\, and producing chart-topping tracks for esteemed artists acr
 oss the globe. Beyond their own success\, they are dedicated to nurturing 
 the next generation of artists and performers\, offering inspirational and
  industry-leading workshops aimed at reaching and enlightening young talen
 ts. Musae stands at the forefront of the female vocal band scene\, continu
 ously pushing boundaries\, and delivering unforgettable experiences throug
 h their unrivaled artistry.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https
 ://northofboston.org/event/musae-vocal/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/musae-vocal/
END:VEVENT
