UID:fc76ecef4cea500d48e0b8e0f1f3d6@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join John Jerome and his Island Cowboy Band\, an all star line
 up of some of New England’s premier musical talent. This will be an expl
 oration of a life in song from over 25 years of songwriting. Stories weath
 ered in reference to this beautiful coastal town and beyond. Join us on Fr
 iday January 22nd for a celebration of the joy of music\, and let’s open
  a new chapter with a brand new full length record for you all to enjoy.\n
