BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gabe Dixon
DTSTART:20270212T200000
DTEND:20270212T220000
DTSTAMP:20261110T190930Z
UID:8241f44bb5180d2285b77fc0361285@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Born and raised in Tennessee\, Gabe Dixon is a Nashville based
  singer-songwriter and multi-instrumentalist. Since he first emerged in 19
 99\, he has been penning honest and heartfelt songs that continue to garne
 r fans and crowds across the globe. Gabe’s songs have been covered by ma
 ny\; Garth Brooks\, Taj Mahal\, Keb Mo and Ben Rector to name a few. Gabe
 ’s music has also appeared in major films such as The Proposal and TV sh
 ows such as Nashville\, Grey’s Anatomy\, Vampire Diaries\, and Parks & R
 ecreation. Along with his own appearances on Jimmy Kimmel Live! and The La
 te Late Show\, Dixon has performed and collaborated with notable acts like
  Paul McCartney\, Alison Krauss & Union Station\, Supertramp\, Loggins & M
 essina\, and O.A.R. In 2019\, Gabe joined the Tedeschi Trucks Band as a fu
 ll-time keyboardist and vocalist contributing significantly to the writing
  and recording of their their last 4-album tour-de-force\, I Am The Moon. 
 He and his trio were subsequently featured on the 36-show “Wheels Of Sou
 l” tour alongside Tedeschi Trucks Band and Los Lobos. Recently\, Gabe ha
 s continued to captivate listeners\, releasing his full-length studio albu
 m\, Parts I’ve Played\, alongside multiple live and studio EPs\, with an
 other full-length record on the horizon.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEven
 t page: https://northofboston.org/event/gabe-dixon/
LOCATION:The Cut\, 177 Main Street\, Gloucester\, MA\, 01930
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/gabe-dixon/
END:VEVENT
